/*
  DashboardStatsWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0033 · DashboardStatsWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DashboardStatsWidget` resolves (table "DashboardStatsWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/DashboardStatsWidget.tsx + registry/system.ts). The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, retry/empty/error copy,
  relative-time buckets, connectivity banners, accessibility).
*/

